# Vetting this recipe as a connector (agent-administered design §19.14.11).
#
# Copy this file to connector.yaml beside recipe.yaml in the DEPLOYED tree
# (~/.config/vornik/configs/agent-templates/recipes/inbox-digest/), fill the
# server's URL, who reviewed it and when, and reload: the paired phone's
# Connectors page then offers "Mail digest (read)".
#
# Vornik ships no vetted server. On 2026-10-13 none was in evidence: the
# server must speak streamable HTTP and offer the read tools this recipe
# calls by exactly these names, gmail_search and gmail_get. Vet the server
# you will use: what it reads, that both tools are read-only, where it sends
# data. recipe_version must equal the recipe's version; a shipped upgrade
# demotes the connector until you vet it again.
title: "Mail digest (read)"
servers:
  mail: {url: ""}
vetted: {by: "", at: "", recipe_version: 1}
